WEBVTT

00:00:08.230 --> 00:00:09.440
You're skilled.

00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:12.490
I'm feeling excited as a member of the German High Council.

00:00:13.650 --> 00:00:15.240
How boring.

00:00:19.660 --> 00:00:21.750
What's with this room?

00:00:22.910 --> 00:00:25.250
It's been a while, Yakumo.

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:32.510
S-Shinra...

00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:39.720
Damn it!

00:00:45.440 --> 00:00:48.690
I want to become a daughter worthy of the Kaionji name.

00:00:49.230 --> 00:00:52.320
That's why I'll kill you and survive.

00:00:56.280 --> 00:00:57.320
Akane-san...

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:02.040
This is the end.

00:01:10.420 --> 00:01:15.220
"Carnage"

00:01:13.210 --> 00:01:14.420
Sorry.

00:01:17.680 --> 00:01:20.010
If I didn't exist...

00:01:21.310 --> 00:01:25.930
You wouldn't have... to suffer so much.

00:01:30.520 --> 00:01:31.690
Nonsense.

00:01:32.020 --> 00:01:35.490
There's no way a Root like you would know how a Sub like me would feel.

00:01:35.490 --> 00:01:38.990
The person I love... is a Sub.

00:01:40.870 --> 00:01:46.210
Why... can't everyone be born equal?

00:01:51.290 --> 00:01:55.710
I... wasn't able to help Keita-kun with anything.

00:01:56.590 --> 00:01:59.470
Even though he's suffering so much...

00:02:01.260 --> 00:02:02.600
Keita?

00:02:05.640 --> 00:02:08.020
You... love him?

00:02:12.730 --> 00:02:13.900
Why?

00:02:16.610 --> 00:02:18.400
Why can't I shoot you?

00:02:19.030 --> 00:02:25.040
I'll die... if I don't kill you...

00:02:26.830 --> 00:02:27.960
Yuki-san...

00:02:35.800 --> 00:02:36.800
Kuraki!

00:02:40.470 --> 00:02:41.640
Yuki-san!

00:02:51.980 --> 00:02:53.810
You're such a fool.

00:02:54.310 --> 00:02:57.820
To think I wasted so much effort preventing you from meeting your Root...

00:02:58.490 --> 00:03:01.990
Instead, you actually gave up your life and chose to head towards death.

00:03:01.990 --> 00:03:04.320
You call <i>this</i> being alive?

00:03:04.320 --> 00:03:07.790
Living a life where I'm nothing more than your puppet!

00:03:09.080 --> 00:03:11.580
Why can't you understand?

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:14.500
Humans are restricted by fate.

00:03:14.790 --> 00:03:17.800
I've already granted you happiness.

00:03:18.300 --> 00:03:22.130
The greatest amount of happiness a Sub like you could ever hope to have.

00:03:23.010 --> 00:03:25.600
This isn't the kind of happiness I hoped for!

00:03:28.060 --> 00:03:30.100
How unfortunate, Yuki.

00:03:30.730 --> 00:03:36.110
My wife perished in the commotion caused by Ibuki and his friends' intrusion.

00:03:36.440 --> 00:03:40.490
I'll swear to you that I'll support the Kaionji family on your behalf.

00:03:42.240 --> 00:03:43.990
During your funeral, that is.

00:03:44.990 --> 00:03:46.620
Kuraki!

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:54.290
What?

00:03:55.130 --> 00:03:57.630
I beg of you, stop this already!

00:04:01.170 --> 00:04:02.510
This is...?

00:04:02.970 --> 00:04:04.720
I sense Tera flowing from that direction.

00:04:04.720 --> 00:04:05.800
What?

00:04:13.060 --> 00:04:15.150
You fool! What are you doing?

00:04:16.100 --> 00:04:19.150
Sorry, Riona-san...

00:04:19.520 --> 00:04:22.740
Have your movements slowed down since leaving the pure lands, Yakumo?

00:04:23.490 --> 00:04:24.490
Shinra!

00:04:24.490 --> 00:04:25.660
You know him?

00:04:26.160 --> 00:04:28.830
He, like us, is a Mototsumitama from the Shishigami clan.

00:04:29.120 --> 00:04:32.960
He's one of the ones who followed Brother and left the pure lands.

00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:37.670
It's an honor that you still remember me, Princess.

00:04:37.960 --> 00:04:41.550
Shinra, why did you betray our clan?

00:04:41.880 --> 00:04:43.420
Betray?

00:04:43.420 --> 00:04:47.800
Everything started the moment you were born.

00:04:48.850 --> 00:04:52.560
We were only obeying the orders of our master, Reishin-sama.

00:04:52.810 --> 00:04:55.810
Brother was the first one who betrayed us!

00:04:56.230 --> 00:04:57.850
Reishin-sama has disappeared.

00:04:57.850 --> 00:05:02.900
The remaining Mototsumitama of the Shishigami clan have lost their hopes.

00:05:03.150 --> 00:05:07.070
We are now working under Kuraki-sama while we seek for a place to die.

00:05:08.370 --> 00:05:13.580
Princess, it would give me everlasting pleasure if you joined me in death.

00:05:16.250 --> 00:05:17.830
Synchro?

00:05:18.080 --> 00:05:20.590
Princess, please be careful!

00:05:21.670 --> 00:05:24.090
Look, someone's up there.

00:05:26.930 --> 00:05:28.140
Mayu-chan?

00:05:30.220 --> 00:05:31.470
No.

00:05:32.430 --> 00:05:33.970
She's a Master Root.

00:05:34.640 --> 00:05:38.190
I see. She's a contractee as well?

00:05:39.520 --> 00:05:41.060
Delete.

00:05:47.400 --> 00:05:48.320
What the heck?

00:05:48.320 --> 00:05:49.570
What an amazing flow of Tera.

00:05:57.580 --> 00:05:58.500
Too slow.

00:06:07.550 --> 00:06:08.840
Keita-san...

00:06:10.550 --> 00:06:11.720
Kuro!

00:06:16.180 --> 00:06:17.600
Synchro!

00:06:26.440 --> 00:06:28.240
You call this weak punch...

00:06:29.070 --> 00:06:30.780
an attack?!

00:06:37.790 --> 00:06:39.290
Kuro!

00:06:43.290 --> 00:06:47.590
Damn. Both his offense and defense are incredible.

00:06:47.590 --> 00:06:50.220
She has an abnormal amount of Tera.

00:06:50.880 --> 00:06:52.590
Yakumo said that.

00:06:52.590 --> 00:06:55.430
Otherwise, there's no way Yakumo and I would lose.

00:06:59.100 --> 00:07:00.980
What is going on?

00:07:02.600 --> 00:07:08.690
I heard that she had the strongest flow of Tera among all the Master Roots in the Kaionji Group.

00:07:09.240 --> 00:07:11.280
Such a young girl?

00:07:11.280 --> 00:07:13.200
It's because she's young.

00:07:13.660 --> 00:07:18.700
Through the organization's power, she became a Master Root much earlier than one who would have went though the normal process.

00:07:18.910 --> 00:07:24.040
She was able to absorb the highly pure and thick Tera of her Subs,

00:07:24.040 --> 00:07:27.380
before the flow of Tera of weakened due to growth.

00:07:27.380 --> 00:07:29.710
In other words, a special Master Root.

00:07:30.800 --> 00:07:32.470
Why did you go that far?!

00:07:33.590 --> 00:07:36.470
It's all to realize Kuraki-sama's ideals.

00:07:37.060 --> 00:07:38.520
Sawamura...

00:07:40.730 --> 00:07:41.940
Kuro!

00:07:41.940 --> 00:07:45.860
We must release all of our Tera in order to fight against her Tera flow!

00:07:46.060 --> 00:07:47.770
Okay!

00:07:49.530 --> 00:07:50.860
Delete.

00:08:00.950 --> 00:08:02.620
Don't lose, Kuro!

00:08:19.310 --> 00:08:21.890
Thanks, Keita-san!

00:08:23.060 --> 00:08:24.560
Are you okay?

00:08:24.980 --> 00:08:26.100
Don't lower your guard.

00:08:26.100 --> 00:08:26.900
Okay!

00:08:27.730 --> 00:08:32.400
That man is controlling the amount of Tera that he's sending to the Princess.

00:08:32.690 --> 00:08:36.030
He's able to use something so advanced even though he's just a Sub.

00:08:37.450 --> 00:08:38.530
Forget it.

00:08:38.910 --> 00:08:41.410
I just need to defeat the Princess!

00:08:51.170 --> 00:08:52.670
Don't lower your guard, Kuro!

00:08:54.630 --> 00:08:55.930
Keita-san...

00:08:57.180 --> 00:08:58.350
Delete.

00:09:00.680 --> 00:09:02.060
He's coming!

00:09:02.060 --> 00:09:02.930
Okay!

00:09:10.230 --> 00:09:11.190
Shit!

00:09:11.440 --> 00:09:12.940
Kuro, now!

00:09:12.940 --> 00:09:17.200
Exceed, Megaexe!

00:09:23.910 --> 00:09:25.790
What's wrong, Kuro?

00:09:28.330 --> 00:09:30.960
What's going on, Princess?

00:09:31.380 --> 00:09:34.970
Could it be that you're showing me mercy?

00:09:35.220 --> 00:09:37.220
Kuro, let's perform synchro.

00:09:38.300 --> 00:09:39.470
I can't...

00:09:40.180 --> 00:09:42.220
Why can't I perform synchro?

00:09:43.520 --> 00:09:44.850
Why?

00:09:45.890 --> 00:09:47.480
Delete.

00:09:51.360 --> 00:09:53.400
Kuro!

00:10:00.780 --> 00:10:03.200
What are you thinking?

00:10:03.200 --> 00:10:07.120
She came here to kill you.

00:10:07.120 --> 00:10:11.000
Yes, but she's the same as me.

00:10:11.540 --> 00:10:17.010
We were both tricked and used by you.

00:10:18.800 --> 00:10:20.550
You're such a nice person.

00:10:20.550 --> 00:10:25.020
Unfortunately, Yuki has already met you.

00:10:30.310 --> 00:10:32.520
She'll eventually die,

00:10:33.020 --> 00:10:37.780
and all the luck that she had will belong to you, the Master Root.

00:10:39.280 --> 00:10:43.780
That's what governs the world, the truth of the Doppeliner system.

00:10:44.030 --> 00:10:47.830
No one can stop the wheel of fate once it starts spinning.

00:10:47.830 --> 00:10:48.790
That's horrible.

00:10:49.330 --> 00:10:52.380
Why don't you die in her place?

00:10:52.790 --> 00:10:54.790
Just like Ibuki's mother.

00:10:56.800 --> 00:10:57.800
No.

00:10:59.800 --> 00:11:04.300
I won't obey it, even if it's my fate.

00:11:04.470 --> 00:11:07.850
This person is... She is me!

00:11:09.930 --> 00:11:11.350
Akane...

00:11:15.190 --> 00:11:16.570
Kuro!

00:11:16.570 --> 00:11:18.530
What's wrong, Kuro?

00:11:19.320 --> 00:11:21.570
You don't want to perform synchro?

00:11:22.450 --> 00:11:26.580
No... But... I can't do it.

00:11:27.700 --> 00:11:29.910
I don't know why.

00:11:31.000 --> 00:11:35.040
The Princess's heart is refusing your Tera from entering.

00:11:36.040 --> 00:11:40.590
It's probably because the Princess doesn't want you to die,

00:11:41.300 --> 00:11:45.600
and that feeling is unconsciously preventing her from accepting your Tera.

00:11:47.720 --> 00:11:49.100
Kuro...

00:11:50.850 --> 00:11:52.480
He's coming!

00:11:53.520 --> 00:11:55.560
What's wrong, Princess?

00:11:55.560 --> 00:11:57.610
Your synchro was canceled.

00:11:57.940 --> 00:12:03.610
It doesn't seem to be caused by your contractee running out of Tera due to him being a Sub.

00:12:06.030 --> 00:12:11.870
Defeating a Mototsumitama in that state isn't something I like to do.

00:12:11.870 --> 00:12:17.380
Unfortunately, my contractee doesn't think or feel that way.

00:12:17.710 --> 00:12:19.380
Delete.

00:12:22.760 --> 00:12:23.880
Shinra!

00:12:24.380 --> 00:12:25.590
Yakumo?

00:12:33.310 --> 00:12:35.900
You still have power left?

00:12:44.400 --> 00:12:45.910
Yakumo!

00:12:45.910 --> 00:12:48.530
Kuro, synchro!

00:12:49.330 --> 00:12:50.490
Okay.

00:12:57.710 --> 00:13:00.920
I won't let you touch the Princess.

00:13:06.510 --> 00:13:07.800
How futile.

00:13:10.890 --> 00:13:13.810
What splendid loyalty, Yakumo.

00:13:13.810 --> 00:13:16.310
You're in no position to talk about loyalty!

00:13:17.810 --> 00:13:19.060
Yakumo!

00:13:19.360 --> 00:13:20.520
Kuro!

00:13:20.900 --> 00:13:23.860
It's no good. I can't perform synchro!

00:13:30.240 --> 00:13:31.450
Yakumo!

00:13:36.370 --> 00:13:37.710
Please.

00:13:51.300 --> 00:13:52.720
Not bad.

00:13:53.180 --> 00:13:56.980
But it looks like you still lack control over it.

00:13:59.850 --> 00:14:01.480
How unfortunate.

00:14:02.150 --> 00:14:06.490
I thought that you would understand since you are a Root.

00:14:27.760 --> 00:14:29.260
We got him!

00:14:30.890 --> 00:14:34.180
You intentionally made your Thousands miss him?

00:14:34.180 --> 00:14:35.180
Yeah.

00:14:41.060 --> 00:14:42.480
Punipuni!

00:14:49.110 --> 00:14:50.570
Akane-san!

00:14:52.320 --> 00:14:53.910
Punipuni!

00:14:56.490 --> 00:14:57.870
Akane-san...

00:15:01.120 --> 00:15:02.630
Keita-kun...

00:15:04.630 --> 00:15:06.420
Keita-kun!

00:15:08.630 --> 00:15:11.720
Thank goodness... you were safe...

00:15:11.720 --> 00:15:13.220
Keita-kun...

00:15:14.550 --> 00:15:16.060
Akane-san...

00:15:21.140 --> 00:15:22.480
Damn it!

00:15:27.320 --> 00:15:29.900
Yuki-san, are you okay?

00:15:30.990 --> 00:15:33.160
So, you're a Kaionji?

00:15:33.820 --> 00:15:37.410
That's right, I'm Kaionji Yuki.

00:15:37.410 --> 00:15:40.410
Damn! You were the one who caught Akane-san he-

00:15:40.410 --> 00:15:42.830
No. You've misunderstood, Keita-kun.

00:15:43.920 --> 00:15:45.420
We'll talk later.

00:15:45.960 --> 00:15:48.420
Kuraki will definitely return with his henchmen.

00:15:49.010 --> 00:15:50.420
Hurry up and escape.

00:15:50.420 --> 00:15:53.680
That's right, we can't fight now.

00:15:53.680 --> 00:15:55.300
Where should we go?

00:15:56.260 --> 00:15:57.560
There's a helicopter.

00:16:04.940 --> 00:16:07.440
Bernhard, use your Exceed!

00:16:11.490 --> 00:16:12.950
June!

00:16:16.990 --> 00:16:18.370
You were careless.

00:16:18.660 --> 00:16:22.580
Raiga, go to where Kuraki-sama is.

00:16:32.130 --> 00:16:33.470
Beautiful...

00:16:35.510 --> 00:16:40.680
Since I was a child, I liked to look at the serene winter sky.

00:16:42.560 --> 00:16:47.980
All this time, I've lost track of those feelings, including the desire to look at the sky.

00:16:48.520 --> 00:16:49.900
Yuki-san...

00:16:52.070 --> 00:16:54.450
Thanks, Akane.

00:16:58.280 --> 00:17:00.030
Come, let's hurry.

00:17:00.030 --> 00:17:01.240
Okay.

00:17:10.210 --> 00:17:13.630
Yuki-sama, Kuraki-sama is not coming along with you?

00:17:13.970 --> 00:17:15.880
He has already escaped.

00:17:15.880 --> 00:17:17.220
Roger.

00:17:17.220 --> 00:17:18.010
We'll take-

00:17:18.010 --> 00:17:18.590
Wait.

00:17:18.590 --> 00:17:19.890
Others will be arriving soon.

00:17:21.350 --> 00:17:22.770
Keita-kun!

00:17:23.850 --> 00:17:25.520
Are you okay?

00:17:25.520 --> 00:17:28.400
Sorry, Princess.

00:17:42.290 --> 00:17:44.910
Yakumo! Riona-san!

00:17:49.790 --> 00:17:52.170
Akane-san, you two escape first!

00:17:52.170 --> 00:17:53.670
What are you saying?!

00:17:53.670 --> 00:17:55.050
The enemy is coming!

00:17:55.050 --> 00:17:56.920
We'll buy you some time!

00:17:56.920 --> 00:17:58.550
Don't do that, Keita-kun!

00:17:58.800 --> 00:18:00.550
It's dangerous here! Hurry up and escape!

00:18:00.550 --> 00:18:04.600
No! I don't want to be separated from you!

00:18:05.020 --> 00:18:06.480
Akane...

00:18:07.600 --> 00:18:08.810
Please!

00:18:10.270 --> 00:18:11.310
Let's go.

00:18:11.480 --> 00:18:12.320
Roger.

00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:29.330
Yakumo, are you okay?

00:18:29.750 --> 00:18:32.130
Yes, I'll be fine.

00:18:32.590 --> 00:18:35.760
Sorry, it's my fault.

00:18:36.130 --> 00:18:38.880
Don't worry about it, Yakumo.

00:18:38.880 --> 00:18:40.640
Kuro, they're here.

00:18:55.900 --> 00:18:58.610
Sorry, for my sake...

00:19:00.700 --> 00:19:05.240
You're not the one at fault. The Doppeliner system is the thing to blame.

00:19:06.540 --> 00:19:08.910
Keita-kun and the others will be okay.

00:19:09.750 --> 00:19:12.420
You believe in him.

00:19:12.790 --> 00:19:13.960
Yes.

00:19:15.750 --> 00:19:19.880
Once, I had someone I believed in.

00:19:29.140 --> 00:19:30.310
W-What's wrong?

00:19:30.310 --> 00:19:33.270
I-I don't know. I've lost control!

00:20:09.100 --> 00:20:09.180
This is the first frame of the ED

00:20:16.230 --> 00:20:27.330
As it thaws my frozen body, before we realize it, dawn arrives.

00:20:16.230 --> 00:20:27.330
Itsu Shika Asa wo Mukae Itetsuku Karada Tokete

00:20:27.330 --> 00:20:38.750
I've returned from my untimely death with my awakened memories.

00:20:27.330 --> 00:20:38.750
Sameta Kioku de Hayasugita Shi wo Kaeshite

00:20:39.090 --> 00:20:51.140
The sounds of the bugs weeping, the sounds of the birds dancing in flight...

00:20:39.090 --> 00:20:51.140
Mushitachi no Naku Koe mo Toritachi no Mau Haoto ni mo

00:20:51.140 --> 00:21:07.530
This soundless, white wasteland will be overflowing with their vivid colors.

00:20:51.140 --> 00:21:07.530
Oto wo Nakushita Shiroki Kare Chi ni Afureru Iro wo Sosoide Iku Azayaka ni

00:21:09.990 --> 00:21:12.200
I didn't expect you to come this far.

00:21:13.500 --> 00:21:17.880
You've greatly exceeded my expectations, Ibuki.

00:21:17.880 --> 00:21:19.130
Sawamura...

00:21:20.420 --> 00:21:22.510
No more games.

00:21:31.890 --> 00:21:33.350
Impossible...

00:21:35.310 --> 00:21:40.150
Trump cards are left until the end, Ibuki.

00:21:38.900 --> 00:21:42.140
"Collapse"
